support.prompt_template:
A user opened a support ticket.

{answers}

Respond helpfully and ask for anything still missing.

scam.prompt_template:
A user is reporting a scam.

Scam type: {scam_type}
Reported user: {offender}

{answers}

Treat this as sensitive. Summarise the report and flag whether it needs urgent staff escalation.

billing.prompt_template:
Billing ticket.

Problem: {problem}
Invoice: {invoice_id}

{answers}

Do not promise a refund; gather facts and hand off to a human for anything involving money movement.

bug.prompt_template:
Bug report ({severity}).

{answers}

Restate the repro steps as a numbered list and identify the most likely component at fault.
